TI  - CO2 sequestration and extreme Mg depletion in serpentinized peridotite clasts from the Devonian Solund basin, SW-Norway
T2  - GEOCHIMICA ET COSMOCHIMICA ACTA
LA  - English
KW  - STRONTIUM ISOTOPE STRATIGRAPHY
