TI  - Synergistic Fe/Fe3C@Fe-NC@Carbon Nanotube Heterostructure for Enhanced CO2 Capture and Mineral Recovery from Desalination Brine
T2  - ADVANCED FUNCTIONAL MATERIALS
LA  - English
