TI  - 20th-Century doubling in dust archived in an Antarctic Peninsula ice core parallels climate change and desertification in South America
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF SCIENCES OF THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
LA  - English
KW  - MICROPARTICLE CONCENTRATION
KW  - GREENLAND
