TI  - Can Strict Protection Stop the Decline of Mangrove Ecosystems in China? From Rapid Destruction to Rampant Degradation
T2  - FORESTS
LA  - English
KW  - mangrove forest
KW  - conservation
KW  - restoration
KW  - biodiversity
KW  - seawall
KW  - protection
KW  - COASTAL WETLAND
