TI  - Use of next generation sequencing and bioinformatics for profiling freshwater eukaryotic microalgae in a novel peatland integrated multi-trophic aquaculture (IMTA) system: Case study from the Republic of Ireland
T2  - SCIENCE OF THE TOTAL ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Algae
