TI  - Nickel-modified birnessite's environmental threats: compromised thallium sequestration in marine environment
T2  - ACTA OCEANOLOGICA SINICA
LA  - English
KW  - thallium
KW  - manganese (hydr) oxides
KW  - birnessite
KW  - transition metals
KW  - ocean alkalinity enhancement
