TI  - Contrasting SOC accumulation pathways in estuarine wetlands: evidence from isotopes, biomarkers, and 210Pb chronologies
T2  - JOURNAL OF HYDROLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - SOC
KW  - Estuarine wetlands
KW  - Source attribution
KW  - Carbon sequestration
