TI  - Simulating potential impacts of bottom trawling on the biological carbon pump: a case study in the Benguela Upwelling System
T2  - FRONTIERS IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Benguela coastal upwelling system
KW  - bottom trawling effects
KW  - biological carbon pump
KW  - carbon and nutrient cycling
KW  - CO2 emissions
KW  - PARTICULATE ORGANIC-MATTER
