TI  - Development of a model framework for terrestrial carbon flux prediction: the Regional Carbon and Climate Analytics Tool (RCCAT) applied to non-tidal wetlands
T2  - GEOSCIENTIFIC MODEL DEVELOPMENT
LA  - English
